{"id":"9deaf304c4a0c310","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Critical Sequence","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence — ZFC Ordinal8 Critical Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence — ZFC Ordinal8 Critical Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-critical]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-sequence]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-critical-sequence — ZFC Ordinal8 Critical Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2674ba7ccccdcbbe\" href=\"?note=2674ba7ccccdcbbe\" title=\"58-df-critical\">58-df-critical</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"58-df-sequence\">58-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> (structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:M\\to N\">\\(j:M\\to N\\)</span> (elementary embedding candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (elementary-embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (critical point, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2674ba7ccccdcbbe\" href=\"?note=2674ba7ccccdcbbe\" title=\"58-df-critical\">58-df-critical</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(c,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(c,X)\\)</span> (sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"58-df-sequence\">58-df-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure-universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (sequence index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8CriticalSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8CriticalSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}critical\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8CriticalSequence}_S(c,j,\\kappa,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\n\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(c,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(c(n))\\land\n(n=0\\to c(n)=\\kappa)\\land(n+1\\in\\omega\\to c(n+1)=j(c(n)))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}critical\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8CriticalSequence}_S(c,j,\\kappa,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\n\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(c,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(c(n))\\land\n(n=0\\to c(n)=\\kappa)\\land(n+1\\in\\omega\\to c(n+1)=j(c(n)))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Taking <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span> as the sequence codomain ensures every iterate is again in the domain of the same embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-critical","status":"resolved","id":"2674ba7ccccdcbbe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-critical]]",